    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0258_e2185bb354f8.png\" style=\"width: 277px; height: 155px;\" /></p><p>Mid point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Normal of plane is along the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>.</p><p>Direction ratio&#39;s of&nbsp;normal is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#62;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#62;</mo></math></p><p>Equation of plane is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Only option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;satisfies and is the answer.</p>"
